      "Focus on benefits over features, answering potential questions before they're asked. Ensure all necessary information, such as sizing charts or material details, is readily available and easy to understand.",
      "3. Is Your Pricing Strategy Competitive and Transparent?",
      "Pricing isn't just about the number; it's about perceived value. Are your prices competitive within your niche? Are there hidden costs that surprise customers at checkout? Transparency builds trust and reduces cart abandonment.",
      "Consider offering tiered pricing, bundles, or clear explanations for premium costs. Regularly analyze competitor pricing and customer feedback to ensure your strategy aligns with market expectations.",
